WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,720
I am required to know computer office software so that I can be disciplined

2
00:00:03,720 --> 00:00:05,160
Follow arrangements and complete work in a timely manner

3
00:00:05,160 --> 00:00:06,240
Able to communicate with customers

4
00:00:06,240 --> 00:00:07,240
I should be able to do it too

5
00:00:07,240 --> 00:00:08,560
Priority will be given to students with hard-working backgrounds

6
00:00:08,560 --> 00:00:10,160
Isn't this tailor-made for me?

7
00:00:10,160 --> 00:00:11,760
This is a job posting in the newspaper

8
00:00:11,760 --> 00:00:12,920
It should be pretty reliable.

9
00:00:18,720 --> 00:00:20,200
I'm sure it's nothing good

10
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:26,590
I just found a marriage for you. You can go tomorrow and I won’t go.

11
00:00:27,460 --> 00:00:29,060
Want to sell my wedding for money?

12
00:00:29,060 --> 00:00:30,340
He's not even that old

13
00:00:30,340 --> 00:00:51,180
I'm not sure about my aunt

14
00:00:51,180 --> 00:00:52,420
You tell uncle

15
00:00:52,420 --> 00:00:53,660
Transfer the house to me

16
00:00:53,660 --> 00:00:55,460
I'll go on a blind date, otherwise we won't have to talk about it
